msgid ""
"The last start failed its start-up checks, and some system settings were missing or replaced. Your computer put back {n} from the copy it saved {saved}, then restarted. Your files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"If it happens again, tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgid_plural ""
"The last start failed its start-up checks, and some system settings were missing or replaced. Your computer put back {n} from the copy it saved {saved}, then restarted. Your files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"If it happens again, tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgstr[0] ""
"Den senaste starten klarade inte sina startkontroller, och vissa systeminställningar saknades eller hade ersatts. Din dator lade tillbaka {n} från kopian den sparade {saved} och startade sedan om. Dina filer och program rörs inte.\n"
"\n"
"Lades tillbaka: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"Om det händer igen ska du berätta det för din hjälpare. Spara probleminformation i Wheelhouse skapar en fil att skicka."
msgstr[1] ""
"Den senaste starten klarade inte sina startkontroller, och vissa systeminställningar saknades eller hade ersatts. Din dator lade tillbaka {n} från kopian den sparade {saved} och startade sedan om. Dina filer och program rörs inte.\n"
"\n"
"Lades tillbaka: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"Om det händer igen ska du berätta det för din hjälpare. Spara probleminformation i Wheelhouse skapar en fil att skicka."

