msgstr "Lägg till sex ämnen till i EvenKeelOS-guiden"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Turn New to Linux into the EvenKeelOS guide"
msgstr "Gör om Ny på Linux till EvenKeelOS-guiden"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add the New to Linux guide in System Tools and at login"
msgstr "Lägg till guiden Ny på Linux i Systemverktyg och vid inloggning"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Boot options: common fixes and your own settings"
msgstr "Lägg till Startalternativ: vanliga lösningar och egna inställningar"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix the Shared folders build check: no home folders yet"
msgstr "Åtgärda byggkontrollen för Delade mappar: inga hemmappar ännu"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Shared folders: share home folders on Home networks"
msgstr "Lägg till Delade mappar: dela hemmappar på hemnätverk"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Network safety: Home, Work or Public place"
msgstr "Lägg till Nätverkssäkerhet: Hem, Arbete eller Offentlig plats"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Recognize printer drivers in any folder"
msgstr "Känn igen skrivardrivrutiner i valfri mapp"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Show tool windows inside System Tools"
msgstr "Visa verktygsfönster inuti Systemverktyg"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Open an issue when the image build fails"
msgstr "Öppna ett ärende när avbildsbygget misslyckas"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Lock outside packages and the ISO tool to exact versions"
msgstr "Lås externa paket och ISO-verktyget till exakta versioner"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Name tool windows after the tool, shorter test list"
msgstr "Namnge verktygsfönster efter verktyget, kortare testlista"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Repair deleted system settings and alert on certificates"
msgstr "Reparera borttagna systeminställningar och varna för certifikat"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Put every tool in one System Tools window"
msgstr "Samla alla verktyg i ett enda Systemverktyg-fönster"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Leave nothing behind when a VPN is removed"
msgstr "Lämna inget kvar när ett VPN tas bort"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Get a VPN, with VPNs that keep updating"
msgstr "Lägg till Skaffa ett VPN, med VPN som fortsätter uppdateras"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Give Zoom meetings their own guide"
msgstr "Ge Zoom-möten en egen guide"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Open Zoom meetings in Chrome, in Zoom's web version"
msgstr "Öppna Zoom-möten i Chrome, i Zooms webbversion"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Stop ArtCraft installs from breaking Flathub installs"
msgstr "Förhindra att ArtCraft-installationer förstör Flathub-installationer"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Recognize installers by their usual file name"
msgstr "Känn igen installationsprogram på deras vanliga filnamn"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Offer Linux replacements for Windows programs"
msgstr "Erbjud Linux-alternativ till Windows-program"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix box setup: distrobox mounts read-only folders wrong"
msgstr "Åtgärda inställningen av boxen: distrobox monterar skrivskyddade mappar fel"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Offer Fedora or Ubuntu versions of Windows programs"
msgstr "Erbjud Fedora- eller Ubuntu-versioner av Windows-program"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Offer the Linux version when a Windows program is opened"
msgstr "Erbjud Linux-versionen när ett Windows-program öppnas"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Ship one shim, so firmware adds no extra Fedora entry"
msgstr "Leverera en enda shim så att firmware inte lägger till en extra Fedora-post"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Put Fedora's firewall zone back"
msgstr "Sätt tillbaka Fedoras brandväggszon"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Harden root helpers, firewall and no-password updates"
msgstr "Härda root-hjälpare, brandvägg och uppdateringar utan lösenord"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "New defaults: wallpapers, accent folders, lock screen"
msgstr "Nya standardval: bakgrunder, accentfärgade mappar, låsskärm"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "New default: teal accent color, also on the login screen"
msgstr "Nytt standardval: blågrön accentfärg, även på inloggningsskärmen"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix rollback note, login-loop and stuck tests"
msgstr "Åtgärda återställningsmeddelandet, inloggningsslingan och fastnade tester"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix freeze rollback and cut retries to 2"
msgstr "Åtgärda återställning vid frysning och minska antalet försök till 2"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix the automatic rollback tests"
msgstr "Åtgärda testerna för automatisk återställning"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Real failure tests for automatic rollback"
msgstr "Riktiga felsituationstester för automatisk återställning"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add automatic rollback with greenboot"
msgstr "Lägg till automatisk återställning med greenboot"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Start the Windows layout on the desktop, plus small fixes"
msgstr "Starta Windows-layouten på skrivbordet, plus små åtgärder"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Pause automatic updates for 3 days after an undo"
msgstr "Pausa automatiska uppdateringar i 3 dagar efter en ångring"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add a Desktop layout step to the installer"
msgstr "Lägg till ett steg för Skrivbordslayout i installationsprogrammet"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Desktop layout to System Tools"
msgstr "Lägg till Skrivbordslayout i Systemverktyg"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Keep power-mode switches from waiting on updates"
msgstr "Låt inte byten av energiläge vänta på uppdateringar"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add an optional Windows-style layout"
msgstr "Lägg till en valfri layout i Windows-stil"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix Fedora 45 presets and container policy paths"
msgstr "Åtgärda förinställningar för Fedora 45 och sökvägar för containerpolicy"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Read download sources in Fedora 45's new folder"
msgstr "Läs nedladdningskällor i Fedora 45:s nya mapp"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Move to Fedora 45"
msgstr "Gå över till Fedora 45"

msgid "Fonts and text size are back to EvenKeelOS's own."
msgstr "Teckensnitt och textstorlek är tillbaka till EvenKeelOS egna."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Recommended: Delete the box. It comes back by itself the next time you install {apps}. Anything added to the box another way is deleted too. Your files are not touched."
msgstr "Rekommenderat: Ta bort lådan. Lådan kommer tillbaka av sig själv nästa gång du installerar {apps}. Allt som lagts till i lådan på annat sätt tas också bort. Dina filer rörs inte."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Deleting it frees about {size}."
msgstr "Att ta bort den frigör ungefär {size}."
